{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22688","headline":"和元九与吕二同宿话旧感赠 · 白居易","name":"和元九与吕二同宿话旧感赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见君新赠吕君诗，忆得同年行乐时。\n争入杏园齐马首，潜过柳曲鬬蛾眉。\n八人云散俱游宦，七度花开尽别离。\n闻道秋娘犹且在，至今时复问微之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}